@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About Us";
}

<section class="py-5">
    <div class="row align-items-center g-4">

        <div class="col-md-6">
            <h1>About DogCenter</h1>

            <p class="lead">
                Our mission is simple: help dogs and their humans build happier, healthier lives together.
            </p>

            <p>
                Our story began on a fateful day when our founder decided to fulfill a lifelong dream: welcoming a German Shepherd into her life.
            </p>

            <p>
                Knowing that raising such an intelligent, energetic, and devoted companion would require patience, dedication, and a great deal of love, she embarked on a journey of learning.
            </p>

            <p>
                Over the years, she invested countless hours in training, deepening her understanding of canine behavior, and building connections with experienced trainers, veterinarians, and fellow dog lovers.
            </p>

            <p>
                What started as a personal passion gradually grew into something bigger: a desire to share that knowledge and experience with others.
            </p>

            <p class="fs-5 fw-semibold my-4">
                And so, DogCenter was born.
            </p>

            <p>
                Built on the belief that every dog deserves understanding, proper care, and the opportunity to thrive, DogCenter brings together education, professional services, and genuine affection for our four-legged companions.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-6">
            
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <img src="~/images/about/AboutImg.png" class="rounded" style="width: 150%; max-width: none;" />
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>


<div class="text-center bg-dark bg-opacity-25 p-4 my-5 rounded">
    <h2>Every Dog Deserves a Place to Belong</h2>
    <p>A lot of love, a lot of patience and a lifetime of companionship.</p>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <h3>Contact Us</h3>
        <p>Address: DogCenter, Main Street 10, Capital 1000</p>
        <p>Phone: +359 0899 1234567</p>
        <p>Email: contact@dogcenter.org</p>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-6">
